SUMMARY:Salsaween Latín Dance + Costume contest + prizes @ Komana Brewery
  in Cary 
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n🎃👻 SALSAWEEN
 : Latin Dance Party at Komana Brewery👻🎃\n\nGet ready for a night of 
 Latin music\, dancing\, costumes\, and FUN! 💃🏽🕺🏽🔥\n🎭 COS
 TUME CONTEST + PRIZES! 🏆\nCome dressed and show off your Halloween spir
 it! 👻🎃\n\nSALSA • BACHATA • MERENGUE • LATIN HITS\nCary’s We
 dnesday night Latin dance social is where the community comes together to 
 DANCE! 💃🏽🕺🏽\n\nWhether you're coming to dance\, celebrate\, dr
 ess up\, or simply enjoy the Latin vibes — Salsaween is the place to be!
 \n\n👻 Grab your costume. Bring your friends. Let's make this Salsaween 
 one to remember!\n\n⏰ 7:15 PM — Doors open & meet-and-greet mixer\n
 💃🏽 7:30–8:30 PM — Salsa & Bachata lesson - No partner needed. Al
 l levels welcome.\n🎁 After class — Free door prize giveaways\n🔥 8:
 30–11:00 PM — Social dancing + contest\n🎟️ $10 ONLINE & $10 BEFOR
 E 9 PM\n\n🕺 DJ Giovanni playing the best 🎶 Salsa\, Bachata\, Merengu
 e and Latin Hits.\n\n🔥 SPACIOUS DANCE FLOOR\n🔥 DRINK SPECIALS 🍻\n
 🔥 FREE PARKING\n🔥 DOOR PRIZE GIVEAWAYS 🎁\n🔥 COME SOLO OR BRING
  YOUR CREW\n\nWhether you're brand new to Latin dancing or you've been dan
 cing Salsa and Bachata for years\, Salsa4Life Wednesdays is your midweek d
 ance destination!\n\nCome learn\, meet new people\, connect with the commu
 nity\, and dance the night away. ❤️\n\n18+ to party • 21+ to drink\n
 \n🔥 MAKE WEDNESDAY YOUR NEW FAVORITE NIGHT TO DANCE!\n📲 SAVE THIS PO
 ST for your next Wednesday\n❤️ LIKE if you love Latin music & dancing\
 n👥 TAG your dance crew\n📤 SHARE with someone who needs more dancing 
 in their life!\n\nHosted by Salsa4Life.com
