SUMMARY:Karaoke Night — A Step to Gold Community Ballroom
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n🎤 Come sing you
 r heart out with us! Whether you're belting a power ballad or just here to
  cheer everyone else on\, this is a low-key\, feel-good night for anyone w
 ho loves music\, dancing\, and good company.\n📅 2nd Saturdays\, 7:00 PM
 \n📍 6201 Glenwood Ave\n💵 $15 cover\nWhat to expect:\n\n* Karaoke all
  night\, open to everyone\n* Free snacks\n* BYOB (beer or wine welcome)\n*
  Dancing\, good vibes\, and zero judgment\n\nGrab a friend (or come solo 
 — you'll make friends fast) and let us hear you shine!\nHosted by Willia
 m Baez.\nMore info at https://www.eventbrite.com/e/karaoke-night-at-a-step
 -to-gold-community-ballroom-tickets-2000115987761?aff=oddtdtcreator
